<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</link><description>铜、铝和锡都加剧了周二金属的大幅抛售，因为科技股扩大了跌幅，交易员们为美国通胀数据做好准备，这些数据将为美联储下一步的利率举措提供依据。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation'&gt;人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Heads Toward Bear-Market Territory as Selloff Continues&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:57:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</link><description>Rystad Energy表示，随着乌克兰继续袭击炼油厂，俄罗斯的石油加工率已降至二十多年来的最低水平，给该国国内燃料供应带来压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says'&gt;雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian Refinery Runs Plunge to Lowest in Decades, Rystad Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>随着对人工智能行业前景的质疑不断增多，全球科技股的抛售没有显示出停止的迹象，投资者转向债券寻求安全。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着避险需求提振债券，科技股遭遇抛售：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Swoon as AI Fears Spur Rush to Treasuries: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 和 Nvidia Corp. 的信用风险指标周三创下历史新高，同时，随着华尔街对科技行业为人工智能融资而创纪录的借贷越来越担忧，人们的担忧情绪再次达到 3 月份的水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount'&gt;随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave, Nvidia Credit Risk Hit Fresh Highs as AI Fears Mount&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:44:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</link><description>由于科技股再度下跌，削弱了投资者对风险资产的兴趣，美国国债周三全线上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment'&gt;科技股下跌削弱风险偏好，国债上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasury Yields Sink to Two-Month Low as Stocks Rout Intensifies&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/treasuries-rise-across-curve-as-ai-concerns-dent-risk-sentiment</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:49:34 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>